    "description": {
      "en": "Tianjin Heavy Steel Machinery Equipment Co., Ltd. designs, fabricates and delivers engineered-to-order heavy steel equipment. Our work starts from a client's duty statement or drawing set and ends with a commissioned machine on site — design, welding, machining, trial assembly, export packing and erection supervision are all handled in-house.",
      "zh": "天津重型钢结构机械设备有限公司设计、制造并交付按需定制的重型钢结构装备。从客户的工况要求或图纸开始，到设备在现场完成调试，设计、焊接、机加工、试装、出口包装和安装监督均由我们自主完成。"
    },
    "description2": {
      "en": "Roughly 90 % of our output is exported, mainly to mining houses, port operators and EPC contractors in Australia, Europe and North America.",
      "zh": "约 90% 的产品出口，主要服务于澳大利亚、欧洲和北美的矿业企业、港口运营商及 EPC 承包商。"
    },
